        {
          "en": "Cargo ships often carry huge bulks of grain and steel across the Pacific.",
          "highlight": [
            "bulks"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "貨船經常橫越太平洋運送大量的大宗穀物與鋼材。"
          }
